CRYPTOGRAPHIC CONTENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This Work contains cryptographic software, including:

    ML-KEM-768 / ML-KEM-1024   post-quantum key encapsulation (FIPS 203)
    HQC-5                      post-quantum key encapsulation (NIST round 4)
    ML-DSA-65 / ML-DSA-87      post-quantum signatures (FIPS 204)
    SLH-DSA                    post-quantum hash-based signatures (FIPS 205)
    X25519                     elliptic-curve key agreement (RFC 7748)
    ChaCha20-Poly1305          authenticated encryption (RFC 8439)
    AES-256-GCM                authenticated encryption
    Ed25519                    signature verification
    SHA-256                    hashing (FIPS 180-4)
    SHA-3 / SHAKE              hashing and XOF (FIPS 202)
    HKDF / HMAC-SHA256         key derivation (RFC 5869 / RFC 2104)
    TLS 1.3 key schedule       RFC 8446

Import, possession, use, export, and re-export of cryptographic software is
regulated in some jurisdictions. Compliance is the redistributor's
responsibility. The Licensor imposes no export restriction of its own.

These implementations are verified against published test vectors from the
relevant RFCs and NIST publications. They have NOT been independently
audited or certified, and verification against test vectors does not
establish resistance to side-channel attack, fault injection, or an
adversary with physical access.

